SCTP::client_port
       Returns the SCTP port/service number of the specified client.

SYNOPSIS
       SCTP::client_port

DESCRIPTION
       Returns the SCTP port/service number of the specified client. This command is equivalent to the command clientside {
       SCTP::remote_port }.

       SCTP::client_port
	   Returns the SCTP port/service number of the specified client.

RETURN VALUE
VALID DURING
EXAMPLES
	when CLIENT_ACCEPTED {
	    if { [SCTP::client_port] > 1000 } {
		pool slow_pool
	     }
	      else {
		 pool fast_pool
	       }
	}

HINTS
SEE ALSO
